bp 1

name        growing cottage
author      autarkia
version     1
orientation all
flippable   true

materials
  1 option overworld_wood
  2 option any_color

groups
  wing      optional  east
  beds      required  one two three four
  workshop  optional  table
  cellar    optional  storage
  beds.three needs wing.east
  beds.four needs wing.east

legend
  o $1 log[axis=y]
